onsciousness. They have explored the whole spectrum of approaches from phil=
osophy of mind and cognitive science, to neurobiology, pharmacology, and mo=
lecular dynamics, phenomenological accounts, and physics. The aim is to lay=
 a sound scientific foundation for future research.
